Handle remote Back during held seeks and scrubs

The Back debounce, seek cancellation, and scrub move suppression from:
https://github.com/bobsupra/NuvioTVOS/commit/79a76793

Cinema keeps its own controls exit handling and Dolby Vision defaults.

